OL,3,GNEWSAArson fear after cricket pavilion
OL,4,Adestroyed by fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA historic cricket pavilion in the
OL,7,Fgrounds of a North Yorkshire estate has
OL,8,Fbeen destroyed by fire.
OL,10,FThe blaze took place at the Deer Park
OL,11,Fpavilion in the grounds of Studley
OL,12,FRoyal in Ripon on Sunday afternoon.
OL,14,FNorth Yorkshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,15,F(NYFRS) said the cause of the fire was
OL,16,Fcurrently under investigation.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
