OL,3,GNEWSAArson fear after cricket pavilion
OL,4,Adestroyed by fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FStudley Royal Cricket Club said they
OL,7,Fbelieved it was "highly likely" the
OL,8,Ffire had been started deliberately. A
OL,9,Fspokesperson said the loss of the
OL,10,Fbuilding would be felt by past and
OL,11,Fcurrent players "who call the Deer Park
OL,12,Fground their cricketing home".
